owing matrices have a rank of $6?$\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 & 5 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & 7 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 4 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 1 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 2 & 2 & 5 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3 & 1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & 4 & 7 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 4 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "First, notice that a matrix of rank $6$ must have at least $6$ columns and at least $6$ rows. \nSo, we disregard the matrix $A$ since it has only $5$ columns and the matrix $B$ since it has only $4$ columns.\n\nAlso, the matrix must have $6$ pivot columns. As we can see, the matrix $C$ has exactly $6$ pivot columns. So, $\\text{rank}(C)=6.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"$C$ only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186348236 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "29a67d7d-2e25-5590-abde-d1402ec76c73" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "D=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 & 0 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 1 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186345721} {:answer/id #uuid "29f33f9e-9e08-5db0-b36d-be6f1dd9ec29" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "A=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186345724} {:answer/id #uuid "2c9743d4-2101-5a2c-afc8-37f657505898" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "C=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186345751} {:answer/id #uuid "b501c5cf-0be2-5e2f-9091-f9709bb59c48" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "E=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1 & 2 & 4 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 3 